{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>From oppression</b> — it is oppression in secret." "<b>And violence</b> — in the open, from the root of נחמסו עקביך, even though they are poor." "<b>And their blood is precious</b> — like the expression דמים לו. The meaning: they are precious in his eyes; he does not want them killed, therefore after him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 72, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:02.799553495Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}